  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "大自然ê洗禮"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：張寶明</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">歇睏日來郊外ê淺山仔行行--leh，享受秋凊ê涼風，走揣樹林ê祕密。Nah光iānn-iānn ê日頭，頗略仔燒lō；唚微微仔吹ê秋風，淡薄仔冷淡。Am-poo-tsê bih leh樹林偷叫幾聲仔，吱叫尾站ê歲月；愛sńg ê膨鼠踮leh樹頂sńg走sio jiok，舞弄青春ê活力。孤一種ê野花霸占山崎，開滿淺粉紅仔色ê花蕊，講he是伊ê花海。行tī tsit條山路bē寂寞，尪仔頭ê影像phong-phài多變，心情透lām精彩ê氣氛，sù-sī koh輕鬆，是一tsuā大自然風味ê旅行。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">Tīnn滿視線ê草仔埔，beh坐、beh the、beh倒，隨在--你。無體統mā免歹勢，無人tshap--你。雙手歡迎，享受大自然ê tshenn-tshau，suh飽清氣koh新鮮ê空氣，無人ē講你貪心、講你過份，tsia本tsiânn就是大自然食kah飽--ê。Tī tsia感受--著ê心思、iah--出-來ê心情，貼tī面肉，無人管你leh想啥？就hōo你ê心，kap一人一樣無親像ê表情款，tuè風去飛，tháu放一切，sńg hōo夠khuì tsiah講。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">翻頭慢慢仔、輕輕仔行tī平靜ê大路，koh來放空頭殼，放飛心思。欣賞苦楝舅變色ê花果，安搭心靈，tháu放鬱積ê壓力，tng tio̍h時；吹凊冷ê微風，鼻秋ê氣味，tam起飛ê想像，tng tio̍h時。Tsín親像免收線ê風吹、免入櫥ê粉鳥、免回溪ê紅鰱魚，自由自在有夠好。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">經過一遍koh一遍ê樹林，拍開心窗，空氣ê氣味有影無仝，he是心情輕鬆ê記持，he是beh叫醒細胞起來唱歌ê hoo-lú-bóng。目睭規个金--起-來，身軀規个精神--起-來。Tsit搭，有夠讚！有suí景做目睭仁ê畫布，hōo入秋ê風微微仔摸過面，靜靜仔聽大自然ê演奏，若ē-tàng配一杯俗俗--à ê lā-thé，沓沓仔kā tsit tsūn清閒ê滋味鼻芳--一-下，生活ê價值就tī tsit當時。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: medium;\">自生--來，節氣ê記持kám kan-ta是循環ê時間niâ？生活ê路草kám kan-ta是來kap去ê空間niâ？Kám tio̍h hông捆縛？我看iáu是隨時掠ân tsit當時，行出火拭盒仔狹tsinn ê生活，nǹg入大自然曠闊ê心懷，thuā淨人生ê uè-suè，剝落規身ê舊皮囊，鬥新pān ê精、氣、神， 快樂活tī suà--落-來ê日子，精彩lán ê人生。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgP231Aruc2grWWXOuwjj_KGMmU5oR94D9znIh6N1La6t11hGi1RN7AwEwX-EYNPXsAqHeeWPsx-JH520nkoa0Tg3WLUx2scVXftGFdoKLAWVMeXkHFzXB4Kv46-2FwSp5t1PuVasA2J9-s/s1424/330%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgP231Aruc2grWWXOuwjj_KGMmU5oR94D9znIh6N1La6t11hGi1RN7AwEwX-EYNPXsAqHeeWPsx-JH520nkoa0Tg3WLUx2scVXftGFdoKLAWVMeXkHFzXB4Kv46-2FwSp5t1PuVasA2J9-s/w450-h640/330%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgGXG2XR8jhA9kXHk2ph6HxawuCsQA2em1YxTommJP_Z0BVHUlNM8viedbyOhgZBccgcJGU-l43fc4MskDP0EB7b79APTHaVFzpYV8al9D8sghdn1sKoZefwkn8_jleun_xoraQxqv24MZg/s2048/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1330%25E6%259C%259F_%25E9%25BB%2591%25E7%2599%25BD%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%2581022.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2048\" data-original-width=\"1450\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgGXG2XR8jhA9kXHk2ph6HxawuCsQA2em1YxTommJP_Z0BVHUlNM8viedbyOhgZBccgcJGU-l43fc4MskDP0EB7b79APTHaVFzpYV8al9D8sghdn1sKoZefwkn8_jleun_xoraQxqv24MZg/w454-h640/%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1330%25E6%259C%259F_%25E9%25BB%2591%25E7%2599%25BD%25E5%2585%25A7%25E9%25A0%2581022.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><div><span><b>#</b></span><b>生活ê藝術&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報330期，2021年9月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">--------------------------------------------</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div></div></div>"
